---
import '../styles/sections.css';
---
<section class="for2" data-section="for-two">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">For two</p><h2>Whoever your one person is.</h2></div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="w2"><span class="n2">1</span><h3>My partner</h3><p>Across the room, or across the world.</p></div>
      <div class="w2"><span class="n2">2</span><h3>My close friend</h3><p>The one you would call first.</p></div>
      <div class="w2"><span class="n2">3</span><h3>My family</h3><p>A sibling, a parent, a cousin. Both of you 18 or over.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="far">Lagos and London, or Lisbon and Los Angeles. Mọyì keeps one shared day for both of you, whatever the time zones say.</p>
  </div>
</section>
